    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779530/extras/sc.PNG?t=1706555054\" /></span><br><br>Gun Gladiator is a gory fast-paced retro shooter inspired by games like <i>Doom</i> and <i>Quake</i>. In this post apocalyptic world, players will have to battle and survive hordes of enemies sent by the emperor. Will you master the arena and become the next champion?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><strong>Brutal and challenging combat</strong><br>Experience a fast-paced and bloody combat worthy of classic old school FPS games like <i>Doom</i> and <i>Quake</i>.<br><br><strong>Character Progression</strong><br>Purchase or upgrade your weapons and items. Create the arsenal to suit your gameplay style.<br><br><strong>Multiples environment</strong><br>Fight in an ever changing arena and face new challenges.<br><br><strong>A Roguelike Experience</strong><br>Death is not the end. Fight, die, repeat!",
